%% MUPP-004 Birthday card
%% The start page builds the deck on the server; the browser browses it and locks it while a list is open.
flowchart TD
    A[Visitor opens the start page] --> B[Server reads kids and wishes]
    B --> C{Any kids?}
    C -- no --> D[Empty card: Inga barn har lagts till än.]
    C -- yes --> E[Build cards: R2, month and age only: R6]
    E --> F[Deck: nearest card on top]
    F --> G{Browse: swipe, buttons, arrows R8}
    G --> F
    F --> H{Press Önskelista or Öppna kid R4 R7}
    H --> I[List unfolded, deck locked R9]
    I -- Escape or the button --> F
